{"text": "An old man with gray hair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was running away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And something fell. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Off his head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was his wig. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I ran after him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But I could not catch him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was faster. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In fact the old man was not old. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was a young man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With long brown hair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I went to the crime scene. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And there were pieces of cake. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All over the painting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was also a wheelchair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Near the painting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And I found a cake box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Next to the wheelchair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The box was from Camilas Bakery.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "n", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "g", "r", "a", "y", " ", "h", "a", "i", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "a", "s", " ", "r", "u", "n", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "w", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "f", "e", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "f", "f", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "h", "e", "a", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "w", "i", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "r", "a", 